msgid ""
"plumnin [juego] [opciones]\n"
"\n"
"  juego                  cartucho (.gb .gbc .nes .sfc .smc .zip)\n"
"  --fullscreen           abrir a pantalla completa\n"
"  --windowed             abrir en ventana\n"
"  --console-mode         para jugar con mando (Steam Deck, ROG Ally...): pantalla completa,\n"
"                         biblioteca y letra grande (--desktop-mode para no usarlo)\n"
"  --3d / --2d            con o sin la vista pseudo-3D\n"
"  --filter f             none, scanlines o crt\n"
"  --upscaling u          none, xbr o anime4k (experimental)\n"
"  --fps                  mostrar el contador de FPS con su gráfica\n"
"  --region r             auto, jp, us o eu\n"
"  --load-state N         cargar el estado guardado N (0-9) del juego\n"
"  --host                 alojar una partida en red con el juego (puerto del menú Red)\n"
"  --join direccion       unirse a la partida en red de ese anfitrión (IP:puerto)\n"
"  --library carpeta      abrir la biblioteca de esa carpeta (se puede repetir)\n"
"  --list                 con --library: verla como lista en vez de cuadrícula\n"
"  --cheats               abrir los trucos del juego, con sus listas de internet\n"
"  --achievements         abrir la ventana de RetroAchievements\n"
"  --game-options         abrir las opciones propias del juego\n"
"  --game-options controls   ...en la pestaña de sus controles\n"
"  --test-pattern [gb|gbc|nes|snes]   abrir la imagen de prueba en vez de un juego\n"
"  --record f.avi         grabar la partida desde el principio, en vídeo (.avi) o GIF (.gif)\n"
"  --screenshot f.png     guardar una captura tras --frames N fotogramas y salir\n"
"\n"
"La pantalla completa y la región dadas aquí valen solo para esta vez."
msgstr ""
"plumnin [game] [options]\n"
"\n"
"  game                   cartridge (.gb .gbc .nes .sfc .smc .zip)\n"
"  --fullscreen           open in full screen\n"
"  --windowed             open in a window\n"
"  --console-mode         for playing with a pad (Steam Deck, ROG Ally...): full screen,\n"
"                         the library and big letters (--desktop-mode to turn it off)\n"
"  --3d / --2d            with or without the pseudo-3D view\n"
"  --filter f             none, scanlines or crt\n"
"  --upscaling u          none, xbr or anime4k (experimental)\n"
"  --fps                  show the FPS counter with its graph\n"
"  --region r             auto, jp, us or eu\n"
"  --load-state N         load the game's saved state N (0-9)\n"
"  --host                 host a netplay game with the game (port from the Network menu)\n"
"  --join address         join that host's netplay game (IP:port)\n"
"  --library folder       open the library of that folder (can be repeated)\n"
"  --list                 with --library: show it as a list instead of a grid\n"
"  --cheats               open the game's cheats, with their internet lists\n"
"  --achievements         open the RetroAchievements window\n"
"  --game-options         open the game's own options\n"
"  --game-options controls   ...on the tab of its controls\n"
"  --test-pattern [gb|gbc|nes|snes]   open the test pattern instead of a game\n"
"  --record f.avi         record the game from the start, as video (.avi) or GIF (.gif)\n"
"  --screenshot f.png     save a screenshot after --frames N frames and quit\n"
"\n"
"The full screen and region given here apply to this time only."

